      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso (as conserved)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[His serv]ant</li>\n<li>[In the name of God, t]he merciful, the compassionate.</li>\n<li>[His slave and servant informs] his loftiness, may God preserve his strength and double his good fortune</li>\n<li>[and vanquish his enviers and enemies] and informs (him) that he is among his servants (i.e., a government official) and among those who are encompassed by</li>\n<li>[his mercy and compassion]. His slave has no one to intercede on his behalf</li>\n<li>[&hellip;] and his good consideration of (the matter). He asks</li>\n<li>[for his generosity and benefaction] (in granting him) a (position in) government service &hellip; asks &hellip; (so that) his family (may) &hellip;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
